					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="869" height="855" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Harry Potter 76450 Book Nook Hogwarts Express June 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 869w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 869px) 100vw, 869px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Good Morning LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/5-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-12-2026/">5 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 12, 2026 (50% off Harry Potter Book Nook &#038; More)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Morning LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96577 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="934" height="684" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 934w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x220.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x562.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 934px) 100vw, 934px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deal would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Book-Nook/dp/B0DRW7WRX3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=30279c5ccbce5cd8058a43088a780c1b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Book Nook: Hogwarts Express 76450</a> at 50% off for <strong>$50</strong> (reg.$99.99). Don&#8217;t wait too long though as this epic price will not last!</p>
<p>Below are 10 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 11, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>5 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, November 12, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>50% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Building-Educational-Toddlers-Preschoolers/dp/B0CGY3M81Y?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d2af567f89379aa0520efd599604f157&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO DUPLO My First Animal Train 10412</a> <strong>$9.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
<li>15% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Potter-Hagrid-Harrys-Building/dp/B0FMS7Q3S5?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=19c02ec25f1931db788ebe209c17e1c4&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Hagrid &amp; Harry’s Privet Drive Escape 76459</a> <strong>$16.99</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87606 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Duplo-10412-Animal-Train-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="896" height="594" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Duplo-10412-Animal-Train-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1279w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Duplo-10412-Animal-Train-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Duplo-10412-Animal-Train-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x679.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/LEGO-Duplo-10412-Animal-Train-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x509.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 896px) 100vw, 896px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102835 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76459-Hagrid-Harrys-Privet-Drive-Escape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="879" height="859" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76459-Hagrid-Harrys-Privet-Drive-Escape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 879w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76459-Hagrid-Harrys-Privet-Drive-Escape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x293.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76459-Hagrid-Harrys-Privet-Drive-Escape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x751.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 879px) 100vw, 879px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>44% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Classic-Large-Creative-Brick/dp/B00NHQF6MG?th=1&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e9beb62e08f9150e2b1569cd9b62216f&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Classic Large Creative Brick Box 10698</a> <strong>$33.49</strong> (reg.$59.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Astronaut-Spaceship-Building-Creative/dp/B0BLJ4FDT4?th=1&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d375be80ca5a127b07b77bc306b8e740&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Space Shuttle 31134</a> <strong>$7.99</strong> (reg.$9.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-80146 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31134-Space-Shuttle-March-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="981" height="853" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31134-Space-Shuttle-March-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 981w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31134-Space-Shuttle-March-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x261.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31134-Space-Shuttle-March-2023-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x668.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 981px) 100vw, 981px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-61749 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LEGO-Classic-10698-Large-Creative-Brick-Box-Packaging.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="1000" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LEGO-Classic-10698-Large-Creative-Brick-Box-Packaging.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LEGO-Classic-10698-Large-Creative-Brick-Box-Packaging-300x250.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LEGO-Classic-10698-Large-Creative-Brick-Box-Packaging-1024x853.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LEGO-Classic-10698-Large-Creative-Brick-Box-Packaging-768x640.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>50% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Book-Nook/dp/B0DRW7WRX3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=30279c5ccbce5cd8058a43088a780c1b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Book Nook: Hogwarts Express 76450</a> <strong>$50</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96576 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="869" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 869w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 869px) 100vw, 869px" /></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96577 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="934" height="684" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 934w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x220.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x562.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 934px) 100vw, 934px" /></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
