<p>Walmart US Online LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 are now live! There are over 15 LEGO sets</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-wal-mart-lego-early-black-friday-deals-2026-now-live-over-15-sets-discounted/">[US] Wal-Mart LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 Now Live: Over 15 Sets Discounted</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/4wug2v22u5sxc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114622 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-2.jpg" alt="" width="983" height="780" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-2.jpg 983w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-2-300x238.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-2-768x609.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 983px) 100vw, 983px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/8iblat2mcr0yo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Walmart US Online</a> LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 are now live! There are <a href="https://howl.link/4wug2v22u5sxc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 15 LEGO sets discounted</a>. Save big on a wide selection of LEGO sets including stuff like IDEAS Home Alone for<strong> $200</strong> (reg.$299.99) and lots more! Act fast as a lot of these epics deals like the Gingerbread AT-AT Walker, Up-Scaled Santa Minifigure and more would not last long.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/4wug2v22u5sxc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114621 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List.jpg" alt="" width="989" height="807" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List.jpg 989w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-300x245.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-768x627.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 989px) 100vw, 989px" /></a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget to visit our website regularly and subscribe to our email list so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO deals that are in the United States!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
