										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday-early-deals%2F1356285316422%3FcatId%3D10011%26facet%3Dretailer_type%253AWalmart%257C%257Cbrand%253ALEGO" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114617 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List.jpg" alt="" width="757" height="768" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List.jpg 757w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Early-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-List-296x300.jpg 296w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Sales &amp; Deals are now live! There are <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday-early-deals%2F1356285316422%3FcatId%3D10011%26facet%3Dretailer_type%253AWalmart%257C%257Cbrand%253ALEGO" target="_blank" rel="noopener">8 LEGO sets on sale with various saving percentages</a>. There&#8217;s also the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-DUPLO-Town-3-1-Animals-Wheels-Building-Toy-Learning-Play-Set-Toddler-Boys-Girls-Ages-2-Animal-Blocks-Sensory-Skills-Practice-Pretend-Gift-Idea-1%2F2H57T3JA6NHJ%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO DUPLO Town 3 in 1 Animals on Wheels 10448</a> on sale for <strong>$24.86</strong> (reg.$44.99). Savings work out to be 44% off.</p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fip%2FLEGO-DUPLO-Town-3-1-Animals-Wheels-Building-Toy-Learning-Play-Set-Toddler-Boys-Girls-Ages-2-Animal-Blocks-Sensory-Skills-Practice-Pretend-Gift-Idea-1%2F2H57T3JA6NHJ%3FclassType%3DREGULAR%26athbdg%3DL1800" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96743 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="852" height="862" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 852w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-297x300.jpg 297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x777.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px" /></a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>*<strong>More great LEGO sales buys can be found on the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Dlego%26facet%3Dfacet_ss_BestSellers%253ABestSellers%257C%257Cretailer_type%253AWalmart%26affinityOverride%3Ddefault" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Bestsellers List</a>. </strong>Make sure to filter the seller to Wal-Mart Canada (and not third party sellers) and choose Best Selling Items.</p>
<p>We also have a <strong><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
