		<title>[Canada] Wal-Mart LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Deals: November 12-18</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-12-18/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-12-18/#respond</comments>
		
