					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Speed Champions 77260 The Fast and The Furious Toyota Supra MK4 Summer June 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-77260-The-Fast-and-The-Furious-Toyota-Supra-MK4-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders</p>
