										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p>Below are 6 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 11, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>6 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 11, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>21% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Ornaments-Christmas-Building-Decorations/dp/B0G2KJ8V5R?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=cfd1ea2421d0ecbdb10198cb9397b5f8&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Snowman Ornaments 40812</a> <strong>$10.29</strong> (reg.$12.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Speed-Champions-77260/dp/B0G2T1J3YH?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=c9eb46768b0a23e92e1275579597150d&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions The Fast and The Furious Toyota Supra MK4 77260</a> <strong>$23.99</strong> (reg.$29.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99925 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg" alt="" width="848" height="807" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg 848w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-300x285.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-768x731.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99926 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg" alt="" width="879" height="858" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg 879w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-300x293.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40812-Snowman-Ornaments-October-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-768x750.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 879px) 100vw, 879px" /></p>
