<ul>
<li>23% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Fortnite-Durrr-Burger-Restaurant/dp/B0DRW49G7P?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=c65b5819eadf9904004d7fa397e15925&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Fortnite Durrr Burger Restaurant 77076</a><strong> $49.99</strong> (reg.$64.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Building-Collectible-Display-Bedroom/dp/B0FMS7GCJ3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=113a062ebb69ccac3cee1240c6aab110&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Star Wars AT-AT 75440</a> <strong>$51.95</strong> (reg.$64.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102698 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="875" height="858" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 875w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x753.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 875px) 100vw, 875px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102699 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="839" height="872" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 839w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-289x300.jpg 289w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75440-AT-AT-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x798.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 839px) 100vw, 839px" /></p>
