<li>30% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Building/dp/B0FMS521QK?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=9e1bf3988e419a8a63d9446be5ef1960&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars The Mandalorian &amp; Grogu’s Speeder Bike 75436</a> <strong>$6.99</strong> (reg.$9.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102790 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="864" height="833" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 864w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x740.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 864px) 100vw, 864px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102791 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="917" height="872" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 917w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x285.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Star-Wars-75436-The-Mandalorian-Grogus-Speeder-Bike-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x730.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 917px) 100vw, 917px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-90677 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/LEGO-40743-Christmas-Table-Decoration-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="942" height="878" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/LEGO-40743-Christmas-Table-Decoration-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 942w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/LEGO-40743-Christmas-Table-Decoration-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x280.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/LEGO-40743-Christmas-Table-Decoration-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x716.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 942px) 100vw, 942px" /></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="848" height="677" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></a></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. Toys N Bricks is a participant of the <a href="https://amzn.to/2MZgozv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon US</a>, <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?bbn=6303772011&amp;amp;rh=n%3A6205517011%2Cn%3A%216205518011%2Cn%3A6303772011%2Cp_89%3ALEGO&amp;amp;dc&amp;amp;fst=as%3Aoff&amp;amp;qid=1584647603&amp;amp;rnid=7590290011&amp;amp;ref=lp_6303772011_nr_p_89_1&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=5d48afd4da2b974b81ef49387a5138e8&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon Canada</a> and <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon United Kingdom</a> Associates program which provides advertising fees for sites. As an Amazon Associate, Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
